{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-01_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-01",
  "title": "僵局",
  "storyCode": "6-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d6294f84249b50fd4bb5ac1e00bafc526811f4d5037ef2288617258104c6eaa2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_building_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还好在废城好好准备运动了一下。你们这点人连饭渣都算不上，别说小菜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！罗德岛这种感染者的败类，就这样帮着龙门坑害同胞？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把我们留给龙门是不是就不会脏自己的手？虚伪！感染者的耻辱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被按在地上揍了两拳还有多余力气放狠话，真行啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过你又搞错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喘不过气了？是不是感觉连肺都要烧起来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先是鼻腔，然后是气管，最后是胸腔。我的这根手指，只要再这么轻轻一动......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高温气流就会立即窜进你的身体，膨胀，点燃你的器官，从你的毛孔里喷出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实龙门还可能饶你们一命。我真要动手的话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，哈......唔！呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们一个都活不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不不要！放，放开我！救命！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行啦，我不会做那么过火的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警员！过来。交给你处理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，乌萨斯人，刚才那不叫动手。那是顺手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，终于来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，这边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "刚才那招太漂亮了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈，小意思。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "下次让你看点更厉害的，那招“在不弄断骨头的情况下把手臂反折九十度”怎么样？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "噫，你怎么那种表情......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你在罗德岛也有段时间了吧，难道没见过几个会打架的人吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "跟他们比起来，我算心慈手软的了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "闹得还真大啊。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "那肯定，你看我像那种藏着捏着干活的人吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "要是能把他们吓破胆，不过多久其他人就会不攻自破了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "而且不把场面弄大点，不觉得对不起自己累出的一身汗吗？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别给博士灌输这些呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小兔子！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也别一见面就把我抱起来啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会有这么软的脸蛋......怎么会！别挣扎嘛，让我再多摸摸，又不会少块肉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌......憋嗫叻筷厅吓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们才分别行动不到一个小时，你这是什么反应啊！严肃点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是不可爱的小孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我受够了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，别，我只是在开玩笑！可别再往我脑袋里塞些什么奇怪的情绪了，那种惩罚吃一次都嫌多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你身边那位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，我是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你是谁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次你再对我们感染者同胞说那种话，我会撕掉你半张脸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我还是要警告她，而且绝不会改口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先走了。下处目标点会合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰喉，煌她可能误会了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要紧。毕竟我真的说过那些话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她没理由用那时的事情去批评现在的你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁知道呢，我真的改变看法了吗？我自己也不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以你更要做些什么了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那你现在参与行动，真的好吗？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是因为想做些什么才来的，不管那位煌干员怎么说，怎么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（阿米娅......）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯......作为非感染者，罗德岛现在的处境可能会让灰喉她感到迷茫。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这次行动，也许能让她做出决定......无论是离开还是留下。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（但她习惯了服从命令，很少表露自己的想法，有时候也会口出惊人......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（她的情感里没有恶意。她只是需要机会认清自己。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不过她的实力非常可靠，博士你可以信任她。虽然我们不一定能帮到她，但她一定能帮到你。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦......嘉维尔去哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "按捺不住冲动，去殴打敌人了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她可能想造成些不必要的破坏。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这，不好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，是谁向博士你这么评价她的，有些过分，虽然事实也确实如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们确实不能在这个时间点出差错。赶快去下个巡逻点向她发送联络信号吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使她的行动都在规划之内，但没人监督的话，还是会造成很可怕的后果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "其他的小队呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他小队有精英干员们代为指挥，他们也会向我们报告战况的，放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，我们已经处于联合作战中最关键的一环。这会是龙门决定性的一战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "陈警司呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她有自己的指挥任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "依照我们和近卫局的规划，作为特别督查组的组长，陈警司将带领近卫局的精锐部队，尽可能地阻挡整合运动的进攻性力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一方面，她要“引导”整合运动主要部队的行动方向，逼迫他们前往指定位置；另一方面，她也要尽力阻止其他整合运动小队进入贫民区。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而罗德岛会沿各个巡逻点前进，在行进过程中帮助近卫局其他队伍消灭残余的整合运动，促使整合运动放弃战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后，我们会到达预定地点，贫民区和近卫局一同击溃整合运动的主力部队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这种规模的行动中，罗德岛能做的不多，但我们会尽力完成合约内容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于一些我们和近卫局之间的合作问题......Dr.{@nickname}，我保证会给罗德岛的各位一个答复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过博士，有件事，也许只有你能做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "交给我了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘿嘿，嗯，"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗯......不过，也不是那种强求你去努力表现自己的事。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "欸......别不说话呀！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "那，那我说了？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "好歹表个态呀博士......！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我是不是该表现的严肃点？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不用，不用啦！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "这件事可能也不能太严肃哦！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我会联系煌，让她保护你。会合前这一小段时间，也麻烦你，照看一下煌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "照看她？你是不是对我有什么误会？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这是我第一次知道我甚至有能力保护精英干员。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......不是说武力上的！是说心理上的那种照看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些时候，罗德岛必须与感染者作战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其是现在。我们和龙门间的合作已经出现了一些隔阂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然煌是罗德岛赖以生存的精英作战干员之一，心理要素却也会在一定程度上影响她的发挥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正因为她坚定地站在我们这边，感染者的遭遇才更有可能左右她的情感状态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁这个机会，博士也可以好好了解下她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和她多说些感谢的话，比如说，“谢谢你在废城救了我们”之类的，她会很受用的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我知道了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "真有这个必要吗？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我绝对相信博士你的能力！去啦，快去吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_uptown_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的主力部队正在和我们的其他队伍交战！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们会比整合运动更快到达目标地点，加入包围网的组建！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和他们这么说，“但现在，我们首先要消灭其他还没和主力部队汇合的整合运动。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，没问题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就按刚才通讯里陈警司说得那样做！通讯完毕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们有多久没并肩作战过了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在也不叫“并肩作战”。这该叫“不得已的合作”。你是怎么从废城回来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我当然有自己的机动配给啦，否则怎么去救罗德岛？你是不是在闹别扭啊，一副气鼓鼓的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，让我想想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然还要搜肠刮肚找理由，你这明显是没事找事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，对。背着我营救罗德岛这件事，你可以私下里告知我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是觉得脸上无光，还是觉得自己被蒙在鼓里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么回事，你什么时候变这么坦诚了？我以前认识的陈警官，嘴上可是要绕好几圈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "近卫局防御小队，举盾！放心，就和之前无数次战斗一样，你们的身后，永远会有队友撑住你们！顶好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十步！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弩队，上弦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这段路也被封锁了？不行......我们没地方可去了！只能从这里走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别怕，我们冲过去！跟我上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五步！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攻击手，就位！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冲散他们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——现在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "批次一弩手，射击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长枪队，长枪起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不许哪怕一个整合运动逃出龙门！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_o"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们已经就位了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。只是，近卫局有他们该做的事，你们有你们该做的，这不算越俎代庖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实。林舸瑞是很反对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这件事，由不得他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各方的意见我都收到了。我们没有选择余地，这也是无奈之举。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "舸瑞的女儿会联络你们。此后三周以内，绝不要联系我，一切信息交她保管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就交给你们了。不用担心身后，我会一直看着你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不必再用这个称呼。往事只是往事，我与往事再无瓜葛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，望龙门长治久安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老魏，我们是那个......你们怎么说来着，结义兄弟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，她和我女儿，拜托你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，感觉和你说这些是多此一举。你总不能连自己的妹妹也照顾不好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女儿的名字我已经取好了，就叫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别太放在心上。我全明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我全都明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
